---
description: Use VibeRaven for production readiness on AI-built apps
alwaysApply: false
---

When the user asks whether an AI-built app is ready to launch, deploy, accept paid users, or pass production readiness, run:

```bash
npx -y @viberaven/cli --agent-mode
```

Read `.viberaven/agent-tasklist.md`, `.viberaven/gate-result.json`, `.viberaven/context-map.json`, and `.viberaven/report.html`.

Follow `VIBERAVEN_NEXT_ACTION`. Fix one launch gap at a time. Do not claim provider dashboard setup is complete from repo evidence alone.
